Package: antibodyduration
Title: Duration of Antibody Protection Simulation Study
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("William", "Hart", email = "william.hart@maths.ox.ac.uk",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shared schemas, candidate trajectory models and analysis
    workstreams for the Duration of Antibody Protection project at the
    Nagoya-Oxford Workshop 2026. The package supports a simulation study
    that asks how well the duration of antibody-associated protection can
    be estimated from a given amount of trial follow-up. See
    notes/handout.tex for the methodological source of truth.
